1. Code ported from Chromium (BSD-3-Clause)

   The parsing and filename-generation logic in src/browser_download_filename/
   (_bytes.py, _http.py, _content_disposition.py, _url.py, _filename.py and the
   MIME tables in _data.py) is a Python port of Chromium code, chiefly:

     net/http/http_content_disposition.cc
     net/http/http_util.cc
     net/base/filename_util.cc, filename_util_internal.cc, filename_util_icu.cc
     net/base/mime_util.cc
     base/i18n/file_util_icu.cc
     base/files/file_path.cc, file_util.cc
     base/strings/escape.cc, string_tokenizer.h
     url/third_party/mozilla/url_parse.cc

   The test cases in tests/test_chromium_*.py are ported from Chromium's
   net/http/http_content_disposition_unittest.cc,
   net/base/filename_util_unittest.cc and base/i18n/file_util_icu_unittest.cc.

   https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/

