2. Charset data and code from ICU, as shipped in Chromium (Unicode-3.0)

   The charset alias table, the single-byte decoding tables and the
   multi-byte state tables, corrections and digests in
   src/browser_download_filename/_data.py are generated from the ICU data in
   Chromium's copy of ICU (source/data/mappings/convrtrs.txt and the *.ucm
   files in https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/deps/icu/).
   src/browser_download_filename/_charset.py ports ICU's charset name
   matching (source/common/ucnv_io.cpp) and the way its state-table converters
   handle illegal byte sequences (source/common/ucnvmbcs.cpp).

